--- Drift Detection Architecture ---

The system has a comprehensive credential drift detection system:

  S1 (credentials.json) ←→ fingerprint comparison ←→ S2 (KooCLI config)
  S1 (credentials.json) ←→ fingerprint comparison ←→ S3 (OBS config)

  When fingerprints don't match → inconsistency reported in auth_status
  When config modified after last sync → manualModified: true
  When S2 is encrypted (authEncrypt) → S2 drift check skipped (#533)

  auth_status returns:
    reconciled.inconsistent: boolean
    reconciled.inconsistencies: array of drift details

